"4. Rotate the DIAL job to select \"F-7 CLONE\".\n"
"5. Press and hold in the [BAND(SET)] key. The display\n"
" will disappear for a moment, then the \"CLONE\" notation\n"
" will appear.\n"
"6. <b>After clicking OK</b>, press the [V/M(MW)] key to send image.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. Desligue o rádio.\n"
"2. Conecte o cabo à entrada DATA.\n"
"3. Pressione e mantenha pressionada a tecla [MHz(PRI)] enquanto liga o rádio.\n"
"4. Gire o seletor DIAL para selecionar \"F-7 CLONE\".\n"
"5. Pressione e mantenha pressionada a tecla [BAND(SET)]. O visor\n"
